        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isandīko Kwenhwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamala ū kūzenga ī numba jakwe ū mu nzengo gwa ng'wa Daūdi, ūbeeja n'ipandī ilebe ūkoma hoi iheema kūlwa nguno y'isandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūhaya gīkī, “A banhū a bangī yaya ū kūlībūūcha ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu; ī lyenīlo lyakūbūūchiwa na Balawī dūhū. Nguno hū abo wabasola ū Seeba kūyūlībūūcha ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Seeba, nū kūtūmama ū kū būtongi wakwe shikū ja weleelo bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūbabilinga Yelusalemu pye a Baisilaeli kūlījīīla ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Seeba, bize balītūūle ū kwipandī īlo walī walībeegeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbakobya pye a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Alooni na a Balawī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kohati, wiza ū ntongeeji wabo ū Ulieli, na badūgū bakwe igana na makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Melali, ū ntongeeji wabo walī Asaya, na badūgū bakwe magana abīlī na makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishoni, ū ntongeeji wabo walī Yoeli, na badūgū bakwe igana na makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Elizafani, ū ntongeeji wabo walī Shamiya, na badūgū bakwe magana abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Hebuloni ū ntongeeji wabo walī Elieli, na badūgū bakwe makūmi anaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Uzieli, ū ntongeeji wabo walī Aminadabu, na badūgū bakwe igana n'ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūbitana a bagabji a ba Sadoki nū Abiasali; hamò na a Balawī: ba Ulieli, Asaiya, Yoeli, Shemaya, Elieli, na Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “A bing'we īkī hū mulī batongeeji ba kaaya ja Balawī, shiigelie ng'wiyeeje a bing'we na a Balawī biching'wi, mulalyenhe ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Seeba, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, ng'wize mulītūūle a hipandī īlo naalībeegegije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba Mulungu wise akatūpelanīla ī kwandya kūlwa nguno mutalībūūkije bing'we a Balawī a h'ikanza lya kūlyenha. Twalī tūtamūgije ī nzīla īyo yigelile kūtūmamīlwa a ha kūlīsaamya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bagabīji na a Balaalwī biyeeja, kūlwa nguno ya kūlyenha ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Seeba, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī būlībūūkīja mitī yalyo ī lisandīko; būlībagala ha mabega gabo, gīt'ūmo Musa walī walagīīlīla kūlenganīla na mhayo gwa ng'wa Seeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūsolwa kwa bīmbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbawīla a Balawī kūbasola bamò ba badūgū babo kūbiza bīmbi ba kūyīmba n'ilaka lyawiza, mīmbo ga kūkumīlīja, kūnū jikūtūlagwa malimba, ndono na nzege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī būnsola Hemani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yoeli; būnsola na Asafu ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Belekia, ūmò wa baana ba ng'wawe; ū kūfuma ū mu badūgū babo a ba kaya ya ng'wa Melali, būnsola Esani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Kūshaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlondeela baana ba ng'wabo ba: Zakalia, Yaazieli, Shemilamoti, Yehieli, Uni, Eliabu, Benaya, Maaseya, Maatisia, Elifelehu, Mikineya, Obedi-edomu, na Yeieli; a benabo būbiza balang'hani ba ha milyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bīmbi ba mīmbo a ba Hemani, Asafu, nū Esani ū nīmo gwabo gwalī kūlīja nzege, ī ja shaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba Zakalia, Azieli, Shemilamoti, Yehieli, Uni, Maaseya, nū Benaiya būbiza na nīmo gwa kūtūla malimba kūlenganīla na kalīlīle ka alamosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba Maatisia, Elifelehu, Mikineya, Obedi-edomu, Yeile, nū Azazia, būbiza na nīmo gwa kūtūla ndono, kūlenganīla na kalīlīle kaa sheminiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kenania, ū ntaale wa Balawī ū nīmo gwakwe gwalī gwa kūbatongeela a bīmbi, ū gwenūyo hū gwalī nīmo gwakwe; nguno walī agūdeebile ū nīmo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Belekia nū Elikana binhwa nīmo gwa kūlang'hana ha nyango gwa kūja kwisandīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji a ba Shebania, Yoshafati, Nesania, Amasai, Zakalia, Benaiya, Elieza, būbiza bafuuji ba mbiilūlū kū būtongi w'isandīko. Na a ba Obedi-edomu nū Yehiya būtūūlwa a ha nīmo gwa kūlang'hana a ha nyango gwa kūja ū kwisandīko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbina kū būtongi w'isandīko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Daūdi na a banamhala ba Isilaeli, na bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī-shihūmbī, būlījīīla ū mu numba ya ng'wa Obedi-edomu ī lisandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa Seeba, būūkalyenha na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu akabagunanha a Balawī abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa Seeba; na lūūlū jūsīnzwa nzagamba mpungatī na ng'ondi mpungatī; jūfunyiwa shitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Daūdi walī azwalile ng'hanjo yawiza ya kitaani, gīt'ūmo baalī bazwalīlile na a Balawī a bose abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko, na a bīmbī, nū Kenania ūyo walī ntongeeji wa bīmbi na nang'hani wa shikolo sha kwīmbīla. Ū Daūdi walī azwalile na ng'hanjo ya kitaani ya nyagabīji ya makono maguhī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū pye a Baisilaeli būlīlinhya ī lisandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa SEEBA, būlyenha bakūtūlaga mhūndū kīngī nasho nīyo; kūnū bakūng'ang'aajaga nhaaninga, na kūfuula mbiilūlū; bangī bakūlījaga nzege, malimba na ndono! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
